Neither of the pdf interpreters I used could create a text file which retain the line/paragraph structure at all, ... with this particular sourcefile.

The html source extracted perfectly.
There is unicode 'ef bf bd'
U+FFFD REPLACEMENT CHARACTER
UTF-8: ef bf bd UTF-16BE: fffd Decimal: &#65533; Octal: \0177775
Search \ufffd in VSCode ... Replace with space--space ' -- '
can later reduce double spaces to single : 




